{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"two 10 ft tall, 5 ft wide single pieces of stone appear.  casting the spell 'silent image' he overlays the image of Navar and Amara over the stones, and starts painting the rocks to look like his friends, following the illusion perfectly.","created_at":"2020-08-01T21:03:15.942000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739226769181114539","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
