{"attachments":[{"content_type":null,"filename":"The_Oasis.png","id":"739259527324500038","local_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/attachments/739055141759615027/739259527324500038-The_Oasis.png","message_id":"739259527983267961","sha256":"a8b0d3b850cb6b2660b86b91729b97037b1ab215410cb9e225d381e86ef992ec","size":2714083,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/739055141759615027/739259527324500038/The_Oasis.png?ex=6abf91d6&is=6abe4056&hm=0e06eee0b6cd199f8ae0cc3d0a3fc3b91ccc2fd76de94679333987096768e56c&"}],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"","created_at":"2020-08-01T23:13:26.249000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739259527983267961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Lush green grass, a large pond, trees with bioluminescent moss underneath, so it will glow at night.  These are the predominant features of the Oasis.\n\nThe pond has fish and plants growing in it, with more than a few white water lilies growing in a few places.  There is luminescent algae growing in this pond, making parts of it glow at night.  \n\nIn the middle of the pond is thick, full sun moss growing on a small island.\n\nOn the north west of the pond is a small wooden hut.\n\nOn the north bank of the pond, looking out over the water, are two lovingly made statues, colored with what appears to be glaze, the one on the right is of Amara, the one of the left Navar.","created_at":"2020-08-01T23:13:28.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739259538385141851","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"==========\nat some point during the party Gil made his way back here, jumps in the water, and begins resting","created_at":"2020-08-02T01:19:32.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739291262078943332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"while underwater Gil wakes up.  He puts on his ring of reverse water walking, finally being able to take it out for a spin, and paces upside down on the water surface. he casts goodberry a couple of times, bagging the berries.  He knows he needs to talk to <@!321508500138360843> and <@!260820438026813440>  at some point today.  He realizes this town needs some sort of method of getting messages to people, as you never quite know where anyone is at any given time, and many people don't want just anyone showing up at their house randomly.  There is still too little communal spirit, each group separating themselves from the whole, keeping to themselves.  No one seemed to learn the lessons from the boat.  In Coastal Arcadian he says to himself ||\"I need to have them see, we will fail if we continue our current path.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-02T09:00:01.294000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739407146701029387","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
