{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Still not really sure what part of town to call home, Leaf wanders to the Oasis. Looking around, her eyes sparkle catching the light of the bioluminescent moss. She quietly walks up to the pond and watches the fish swim around, keeping a close eye out for any koi. She crouches down by the water to watch, until she closes her eyes to picture Mello in her tank. ||Hi Mello. I know it hasn't been long since we last talked, but I just wanted to say that I'm glad we're best friends, and goodnight.|| She smiles and falls asleep laying in the grass by the pond, hand on her holy symbol pressed to her chest.","created_at":"2020-08-03T07:29:33.772000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739746769889656863","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Wakes up amongst the vegetation at the bottom on the water.  As he climbs out of the water, He notices a friendly goblin, his friend Leaf sleeping at the waters edge.  He carefully stays away, as to not disturb her as he leaves the Oasis.","created_at":"2020-08-03T12:18:13.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739819414433693697","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"A white owl flies silently in the night, an envelope and a package in its claws. Finding Leaf (presumably here), the package is dropped beside them. The owl makes no attempt at hiding, so anyone here might see it. \n\nThe envelope has written on it in neat calligraphic lettering \"Leaf\". \n\nThe package is a cobalt box, ornately designed, once containing ink, but cleaned.\n\nBoth has had Arcane Lock cast to open for Leaf only. \n\nIf opened the box contains:\n||A small faintly glowing seed||\n\nIf opened the envelope contains a letter:\n||To Leaf.\n\nThis seed was granted me by The Green Man, by promise to bring it here and plant it to bring his influence to Arcania. I wish not to make the moral decision to if this is a wise choice, and I've realised you might be connected to this entity. I therefore hand this to you to plant or hide as wanted. \n\nKyrre||","created_at":"2020-08-03T13:44:36.846000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739841154622816307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
