{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"||I am glad you are near home.  There is a peace to b had when family is nearby.  So how have the colonists been treating you?  If you have a problem with them, please let me know.||","created_at":"2020-08-03T15:26:49.809000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T15:28:19.932000Z","id":"739866878134059038","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
