{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"||Excellant.  In their culture, I was labeled an Ambassador and given a Baron title.  I spent about a year with the Europeans, and found out about this group.  I am hoping to instill respect for our cultures in them, and help build bridges between the two worlds.  So if you have a problem, let me know, and I will do my best to fix it||","created_at":"2020-08-03T15:31:02.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739867939242639370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"When Leaf wakes and sees the package beside her her stomach can't help but drop. She thought this occurrence would have sunk with the sub. She liked getting letters, and appreciated that she was being trusted with something but she's had... Bad experiences with these kinds of things.  She sits up and sighs, considering the letter and the box for a while, before finally caving and opening it.","created_at":"2020-08-03T16:44:52.181000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739886517425799218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
