{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"No its just.. I don't understand the purpose of it I suppose.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:50:36.752000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739993659121860650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"thinks for a moment \"metaphor..... much of how I see the world is metaphor.... so the friend jack asked what i wanted.... so I thought about it.... you told me you were of Europe.... but have lived here and become of here too.... so I wanted to give you a trinket of that.... a small... cheap... meaningful gift that says I understand....\" starts walking to the pond, ring in his hand","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:54:37.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739994668288442414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"She nods \"I see.\" She walks to its edge. \"It's of two places. Like me. And you as well.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:56:04.832000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T23:56:17.230000Z","id":"739995035189248051","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"nods","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:56:16.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739995085558775872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"puts his open hand in the water \"this is my home.... I cannot thrive above water.... so i am always separate... always returning... I have always been of two worlds.... but now.... more\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:57:48.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739995469630931004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"We are always more than where we came from.\" She smiles","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:58:20.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739995602439635025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"It might be our origin but we all have something in us that makes us different, special. \"","created_at":"2020-08-03T23:59:05.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739995794391957566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"so you understand....\"holds the ring up towards the sun \"gold is meaningless on its own.... boring... soft.... gemstones have no real use.... both separate are worthless.... only used to get other things....\" turns the ring a bit \"but together... it becomes something more... to meaningless and boring objects become something of worth when made into a single object.\"  brings the ring down \"so you understand...\" motions to the water \"things only become beautiful when it is more than one thing.... endless water is boring... endless land is boring...\" motions the the Oasis \"beauty\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:04:09.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739997066675093544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
